  "prefLabel": "Psyc 501.01 Obligation to Obey",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Psyc 501.01 Obligation to Obey. All psychologists and school psychologists shall be bound to the ethical standards set forth in this part. Disciplinary sanctions shall be imposed for violation of any standards.\n\nSource. #12035-B, eff 11-4-16; ss by #14210, eff 5-6-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/psyc100-500.html"
